    rdfs:comment "The console's compressor: threshold, ratio and knee set how hard it holds the level down, attack and release how fast, with makeup gain and a dry/wet mix. Kind picks the RMS detector (Compressor) or the peak detector (Limiter), and detector oversampling can run the control path at 4x; detector topology has it hear the input (feedforward) or its own output (feedback). The DSP is omx-dsp's <omxdsp/fx/omx_comp_instance.h>, the console's own compressor." ;
